        {
          "id": "hostility_medium_001_confirmed",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "それなら、私は少し距離を取る。近いままで受け続ける言葉じゃない。",
          "displayText": "Then I am taking a little distance. Those are not words I will keep receiving up close.",
